<title>FINLAND: Technical problem delays Helsinki bourse start.</title>
<headline>Technical problem delays Helsinki bourse start.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A technical problem delayed the start of trade on the Helsinki Stock Exchange on Monday, a bourse spokeswoman told Reuters by telephone.</p>
<p>&quot;Trade will start as soon as possible,&quot; she said, but gave no estimate.</p>
<p>Trade normally starts at 1030/0730 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
</text>
